# Mali G610 GPU Firmware

Panthor 驱动需要 mali_csffw.bin 固件才能正确初始化。

运行以下命令下载固件:
    ./scripts/download-gpu-firmware.sh

或手动下载:
    curl -L https://github.com/armbian/build/raw/main/packages/blobs/rockchip/mali_csffw_g610.bin         -o overlay/common/usr/lib/firmware/arm/mali/mali_csffw_g610.bin
    ln -s mali_csffw_g610.bin overlay/common/usr/lib/firmware/arm/mali/mali_csffw.bin
